.DS_Store
.env
.venv/
vigil.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Dataset artifacts: never commit raw or locked holdout data.
data/raw/
data/holdout/
data/cache/

# Runtime and evaluation output.
eval/runs/*
artifacts/*
*.log

# Deliberate exception: the eval ledger. EVAL.md makes this the source of the
# improvement curve ('never hand-drawn'), and a reviewer has to be able to
# check the promotion decision against the numbers that produced it.
!eval/runs/*.json

# Deliberate exception: a committed snapshot of a real --live run over the real
# ASRS slice. The deployed Cloud Run UI serves this so reviewers see genuine
# model-written briefs over real data instantly, without a per-pageview model
# cost or a dependency on API quota holding across the judging window.
# Regenerate with `make artifact`.
!artifacts/demo_run.json

# Local coding-harness instructions are intentionally not part of the public repo.
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
ac-ai-assistant.md

# Local submission-window burndown (see its own header): a temporary, dependency-
# ordered view of the last ~26 hours before the Devpost deadline. docs/PHASES.md
# is the durable status board and the one a reader should be pointed at. Ignored
# rather than left untracked so a `git add .` on the public push cannot sweep it
# in by accident. Delete after submitting.
PROJECT_STATUS.md

# Local harness/editor config, not part of the public repo.
.agents/
.claude/
.vscode/

# The gcloud CLI was installed into the repo root on 2026-08-29 (the Homebrew
# cask install failed with "unknown install step: copy"; the official tarball
# extracts wherever it is unpacked). Excluded here and in .gcloudignore /
# .dockerignore so it never reaches a commit or a build context.
google-cloud-sdk/
google-cloud-cli-*.tar.gz

# The `docs-collateral` git worktree, moved out to /Users/sush/vigil-docs on
# 2026-08-30. While it sat at the repo root, `git add .` did not refuse it — it
# warned and staged a 581MB embedded-repo gitlink that no clone could resolve.
vigil-docs/
